  "name": "Pumpkin Soup with Coconut Milk",
  "subtitle": "Roasted squash and vegetables blended with warm spices and coconut milk.",
  "description": "A smooth, warmly spiced soup made from roasted pumpkin or squash, sweet potato, carrots, and onions.",
